G4715.def:
**στατήρ**, -ῆρος, ὁ
[in Aq., Sm., for מִשְׁקָל ;]
**a stater**;
(a) **a weight**;
(b) **a coin **(used by late writers of the Greek τετράδραχμον): [[Mat.17.27; 26.16|Mat.17:27 26:16]], WH, mg.†
(AS)

G4751.def:
**στόμαχος**, -ου, ὁ
(στόμα),
prop., a mouth, an opening;
(a) in early Gk. writers, the throat;
(b) **of the opening of the stomach **(Arist.);
(with) in later writers (Plut., al.), **the stomach**: [[1Ti.5.23|1Ti.5:23]]†
(AS)
